{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"九章算術卷第二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"粟米","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"粟米之法：","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"粟率五十　糲米三十","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"粺米二十七鑿米二十四","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"御米二十一小十三半","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"大五十四糲飯七十五","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"粺飯五十四鑿飯四十八","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"御飯四十二菽、荅、麻、麥各四十五","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"稻六十豉六十三","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"飧九十熟菽一百三半","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"櫱一百七十五","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"今有術曰：以所有數乘所求率為實，以所有率為法，實如法而一。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一〕今有粟一斗，欲為糲米。問得幾何？","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為糲米六升。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求糲米，三之，五而一。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二〕今有粟二斗一升，欲為粺米。問得幾何？","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粺米一斗一升、五十分升之十七。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_19","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求粺米，二十七之，五十而一。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_20","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三〕今有粟四斗五升，欲為鑿米。問得幾何？","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_21","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為鑿米二斗一升、五分升之三。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_22","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求鑿米，十二之，二十五而一。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_23","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四〕今有粟七斗九升，欲為御米。問得幾何？","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_24","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為御米三斗三升、五十分升之九。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_25","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求御米，二十一之，五十而一。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_26","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔五〕今有粟一斗，欲為小。問得幾何？","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_27","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為小二升、一十分升之七。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_28","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求小，二十七之，百而一。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_29","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔六〕今有粟九斗八升，欲為大。問得幾何？","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_30","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為大一十斗五升、二十五分升之二十一。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_31","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求大，二十七之，二十五而一。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_32","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔七〕今有粟二斗三升，欲為糲飯。問得幾何？","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_33","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為糲飯三斗四升半。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_34","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求糲飯，三之，二而一。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_35","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔八〕今有粟三斗六升，欲為粺飯。問得幾何？","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_36","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粺飯三斗八升、二十五分升之二十二。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_37","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求粺飯，二十七之，二十五而一。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_38","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔九〕今有粟八斗六升，欲為鑿飯。問得幾何？","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_39","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為鑿飯八斗二升、二十五分升之一十四。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_40","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求鑿飯，二十四之，二十五而一。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_41","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一０〕今有粟九斗八升，欲為御飯。問得幾何？","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_42","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為御飯八斗二升、二十五分升之八。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_43","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求御飯，二十一之，二十五而一。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_44","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一一〕今有粟三斗少半升，欲為菽。問得幾何？","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_45","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為菽二斗七升、一十分升之三。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_46","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一二〕今有粟四斗一升、太半升，欲為荅。問得幾何？","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_47","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為荅三斗七升半。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_48","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一三〕今有粟五斗、太半升，欲為麻。問得幾何？","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_49","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為麻四斗五升、五分升之三。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_50","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一四〕今有粟一十斗八升、五分升之二，欲為麥。問得幾何？","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_51","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為麥九斗七升、二十五分升之一十四。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_52","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求菽、荅、麻、麥，皆九之，十而一。","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_53","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一五〕今有粟七斗五升、七分升之四，欲為稻。問得幾何？","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_54","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為稻九斗、三十五分升之二十四。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_55","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求稻，六之，五而一。","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_56","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一六〕今有粟七斗八升，欲為豉。問得幾何？","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_57","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為豉九斗八升、二十五分升之七。","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_58","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求豉，六十三之，五十而一。","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_59","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一七〕今有粟五斗五升，欲為飧。問得幾何？","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_60","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為飧九斗九升。","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_61","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求飧，九之，五而一。","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_62","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一八〕今有粟四斗，欲為熟菽。問得幾何？","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_63","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為熟菽八斗二升、五分升之四。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_64","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求熟菽，二百七之，百而一。","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_65","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔一九〕今有粟二斗，欲為櫱。問得幾何？","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_66","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為櫱七斗。","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_67","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粟求櫱，七之，二而一。","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_68","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二０〕今有糲米十五斗五升、五分升之二，欲為粟。問得幾何？","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_69","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粟二十五斗九升。","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_70","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以糲米求粟，五之，三而一。","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_71","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二一〕今有粺米二斗，欲為粟。問得幾何？","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_72","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粟三斗七升、二十七分升之一。","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_73","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以粺米求粟，五十之，二十七而一。","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_74","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二二〕今有鑿米三斗、少半升，欲為粟。問得幾何？","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_75","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粟六斗三升、三十六分升之七。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_76","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以鑿米求粟，二十五之，十三而一。","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_77","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二三〕今有御米十四斗，欲為粟。問得幾何？","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_78","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粟三十三斗三升、少半升。","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_79","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以御米求粟，五十之，二十一而一。","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_80","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二四〕今有稻一十二斗六升、一十五分升之一十四，欲為粟。問得幾何？","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_81","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粟一十斗五升、九分升之七。","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_82","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以稻求粟，五之，六而一。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_83","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二五〕今有糲米一十九斗二升、七分升之一，欲為粺米。問得幾何？","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_84","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為粺米一十七斗二升、一十四分升之一十三。","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_85","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以糲米求粺米，九之，十而一。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_86","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二六〕今有糲米六斗四升、五分升之三，欲為糲飯。問得幾何？","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_87","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為糲飯一十六斗一升半。","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_88","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以糲米求糲飯，五之，二而一。","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_89","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二七〕今有糲飯七斗六升、七分升之四，欲為飧。問得幾何？","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_90","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為飧九斗一升、三十五分升之三十一。","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_91","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以糲飯求飧，六之，五而一。","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_92","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二八〕今有菽一斗，欲為熟菽。問得幾何？","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_93","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為熟菽二斗三升。","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_94","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以菽求熟菽，二十三之，十而一。","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_95","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔二九〕今有菽二斗，欲為豉。問得幾何？","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_96","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為豉二斗八升。","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_97","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以菽求豉，七之，五而一。","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_98","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三０〕今有麥八斗六升、七分升之三，欲為小，問得幾何？","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_99","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為小二斗五升、一十四分升之一十三。","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_100","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以麥求小，三之，十而一。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_101","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三一〕今有麥一斗，欲為大。問得幾何？","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_102","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：為大一斗二升。","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_103","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：以麥求大，六之，五而一。","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_104","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三二〕今有出錢一百六十，買瓴甓十八枚。問枚幾何？","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_105","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一枚，八錢、九分錢之八。","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_106","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三三〕今有出錢一萬三千五百，買竹二千三百五十箇。問箇幾何？","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_107","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一箇，五錢、四十七分錢之三十五。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_108","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"經率術曰：以所買率為法，所出錢數為實，實如法得一錢。","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_109","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三四〕今有出錢五千七百八十五，買漆一斛六斗七升、太半升。欲斗率之，問斗幾何。","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_110","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一斗，三百四十五錢、五百三分錢之一十五。","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_111","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三五〕今有出錢七百二十，買縑一匹二丈一尺。欲丈率之，問丈幾何？","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_112","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一丈，一百一十八錢、六十一分錢之二。","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_113","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三六〕今有出錢二千三百七十，買布九匹二丈七尺。欲匹率之，問匹幾何？","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_114","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一匹，二百四十四錢、一百二十九分錢之一百二十四。","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_115","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三七〕今有出錢一萬三千六百七十，買絲一石二鈞一十七斤。欲石率之，問石幾何？","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_116","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：一石，八千三百二十六錢、一百九十七分錢之一百七十八。","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_117","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"經術術曰：以所求率乘錢數為實，以所買率為法，實如法得一。","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_118","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三八〕今有出錢五百七十六，買竹七十八箇。欲其大小率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_119","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_120","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其四十八箇，箇七錢。","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_121","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其三十箇，箇八錢。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_122","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔三九〕今有出錢一千一百二十，買絲一石二鈞十八斤。欲其貴賤斤率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_123","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_124","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其二鈞八斤，斤五錢。","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_125","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石一十斤，斤六錢。","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_126","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四０〕今有出錢一萬三千九百七十，買絲一石二鈞二十八斤三兩五銖。欲其貴賤石率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_127","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_128","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一鈞九兩一十二銖，石八千五十一錢。","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_129","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石一鈞二十七斤九兩一十七銖，石八千五十二錢。","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_130","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四一〕今有出錢一萬三千九百七十，買絲一石二鈞二十八斤三兩五銖。欲其貴賤鈞率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_131","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_132","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其七斤一十兩九銖，鈞二千一十二錢。","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_133","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石二鈞二十斤八兩二十銖，鈞二千一十三錢。","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_134","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四二〕今有出錢一萬三千九百七十，買絲一石二鈞二十八斤三兩五銖。欲其貴賤斤率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_135","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_136","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石二鈞七斤十兩四銖，斤六十七錢。","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_137","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其二十斤九兩一銖，斤六十八錢。","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_138","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四三〕今有出錢一萬三千九百七十，買絲一石二鈞二十八斤三兩五銖。欲其貴賤兩率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_139","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_140","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石一鈞一十七斤一十四兩一銖，兩四錢。","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_141","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一鈞一十斤五兩四銖，兩五錢。","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_142","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其率","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_143","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"術曰：各置所買石、鈞、斤、兩以為法，以所率乘錢數為實，實如法而一。不滿法者反以實減法，法賤實貴。","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_144","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四四〕今有出錢一萬三千九百七十，買絲一石二鈞二十八斤三兩五銖。欲其貴賤銖率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_145","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_146","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一鈞二十斤六兩十一銖，五銖一錢。","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_147","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一石一鈞七斤一十二兩一十八銖，六銖一錢。","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_148","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四五〕今有出錢六百一十，買羽二千一百翭。欲其貴賤率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_149","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_150","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其一千一百四十翭，三翭一錢。","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_151","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其九百六十翭，四翭一錢。","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_152","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"〔四六〕今有出錢九百八十，買矢簳五千八百二十枚。欲其貴賤率之，問各幾何？","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_153","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"荅曰：","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_154","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其三百枚，五枚一錢。","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_155","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"其五千五百二十枚，六枚一錢。","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_cctk_5_156","chapterId":"ch_work_cctk_5","text":"反其率術曰：以錢數為法，所率為實，實如法而一。不滿法者反以實減法，法少，實多。二物各以所得多少之數乘法實，即物數。","sortOrder":156}],"overrides":{}}